<title>PORTUGAL: Council of Europe launches 10 bln escudo bond.</title>
<headline>Council of Europe launches 10 bln escudo bond.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by lead managers Banco Santander de Negocios Portugal and Caixa Geral de Depositos.</p>
<p>BORROWER Council of Europe Development Fund</p>
<p>    AMT 10 billion escudos     INTEREST: 6.67 percent</p>
<p>    MATURITY 10 years   TYPE Fixed-rate  ISS PRICE 100</p>
<p>    PAY DATE 20/2/97    LAST MOODY Aa1   PAY FREQ Annual</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P AAA</p>
</text>
